For your iPhone workflow, open the Markdown file, copy its contents, create PANTHEON/MODULES/ARKFORGE.md in GitHub, paste, and commit.

The important architectural decision is already made: we aren’t trying to copy an existing reverse-engineering tool. We’re building a general way to discover how systems work, test our understanding, and carry useful mechanisms from one domain into another.